{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37821","headline":"读故许昌薛尚书诗集 · 郑谷","name":"读故许昌薛尚书诗集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"篇篇高且真，真爲国风陈。\n澹薄虽师古，纵横得意新。\n翦裁成几箧，唱和是谁人。\n华岳题无敌，黄河句绝伦。\n吟残荔枝雨，咏彻海棠春。\n李白欺前辈，陶潜仰後尘。\n难忘嵩室下，不负蜀江滨。\n属思看山眼，冥搜倚树身。\n楷模劳梦想，讽诵爽精神。\n落笔空追怆，曾蒙借斧斤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}